\title{mermaid2drawml: Convert Mermaid Diagrams to Editable Word Shapes}
\description{
Converts Mermaid diagrams of any type (flowcharts, sequence, class, state, entity-relationship, Gantt, pie, mind map and the others) to natively editable Microsoft Word shapes in DrawingML. Mermaid lays out and draws the diagram in a headless browser; the browser reports each drawn primitive with its computed colours, line styles, fonts and text layout, and these are rebuilt as grouped Word shapes with their labels inside, so the result matches the browser rendering and themes and styles are honoured. Diagrams can be inserted into documents via the officer package, for example in R Markdown workflows. Run setup_mermaid2drawml() once after installation to install the required Node.js packages.
